status GREEN -- bron_resins_landed GREEN on metal, bron_resins_catalog GREEN beside it, exec_bit GREEN, ascii_document under ceiling, listing_census unmoved at 13, roster schema clean and my guard absent from the twelve pre-existing reds
recommend keep-going -- the same reading takes a room argument, so session-logs, counsel and the folded shelves are each one roster row away when a word names them
